00:15:23,386 --> 00:15:24,906
You know, a "rotenburo"

281
00:15:24,906 --> 00:15:26,206
I didn't really go in deep though.

282
00:15:27,466 --> 00:15:29,146
Maybe not running?

283
00:15:31,386 --> 00:15:32,346
But I don't think it was that.

284
00:15:33,506 --> 00:15:34,366
Just normally, you know?

285
00:15:34,366 --> 00:15:35,926
Floating them up

286
00:15:36,926 --> 00:15:38,286
But I had six before.

287
00:15:39,426 --> 00:15:41,146
They only let me have three this time.

288
00:15:41,446 --> 00:15:42,866
You know, the kinda guy who
gets a little frustrated...

289
00:15:43,846 --> 00:15:45,126
You like it with a bottle too, right?

290
00:15:47,266 --> 00:15:48,486
I'm getting tipsy.

291
00:15:51,696 --> 00:15:54,576
"Yeah, it's nice to have a drink
with friends every now and then."

292
00:15:55,696 --> 00:15:57,896
"We sometimes go out for drinks."

293
00:15:58,436 --> 00:16:00,616
"Is Osaka strong?"

294
00:16:01,316 --> 00:16:02,336
"Maybe a little stronger?"

295
00:16:04,008 --> 00:16:05,688
"But you have such a strong face."

296
00:16:07,688 --> 00:16:09,388
"You seemed pretty calm and collected."

297
00:16:10,608 --> 00:16:11,788
"Is this place strong?"

298
00:16:12,668 --> 00:16:13,468
"Weak."

299
00:16:14,828 --> 00:16:16,528
"You definitely seem strong."

300
00:16:20,388 --> 00:16:21,468
"I wonder..."

301
00:16:26,028 --> 00:16:28,008
"Someone I'd love to
have drinks with again."

302
00:16:35,988 --> 00:16:38,088
You guys haven't been to any parties lately,
have you?

303
00:16:39,848 --> 00:16:41,228
You still go sometimes?

304
00:16:42,868 --> 00:16:45,308
You guys are always out drinking.

305
00:16:45,308 --> 00:16:51,048
Come on! Wanting to drink with
people from the same fashion building?

306
00:16:51,988 --> 00:16:53,088
Dungeon time!

307
00:16:54,548 --> 00:16:55,528
Looks fun.

308
00:16:56,228 --> 00:16:57,948
You seem to be enjoying yourself.

309
00:16:58,428 --> 00:16:59,648
I haven't been to any mixers lately.

310
00:16:59,648 --> 00:17:04,208
I did go to some before though.

311
00:17:04,248 --> 00:17:05,748
You still going?

312
00:17:06,068 --> 00:17:06,968
Never have.

313
00:17:07,368 --> 00:17:09,648
Not at all lately...

314
00:17:11,608 --> 00:17:15,468
Speaking of traditional classics...

315
00:17:17,388 --> 00:17:19,068
Like the Yamanote Line game, or...

316
00:17:20,308 --> 00:17:21,328
The Ozawa Game?

317
00:17:22,768 --> 00:17:26,428
I think we should try it this year.

318
00:17:32,848 --> 00:17:34,288
Never tried it before?

319
00:17:34,288 --> 00:17:35,388
Yeah, never have.

320
00:17:38,588 --> 00:17:40,828
More like a punishment game...

321
00:17:40,828 --> 00:17:42,128
It's so cute, isn't it?

322
00:17:42,128 --> 00:17:43,248
Handcuffed together...

323
00:17:43,248 --> 00:17:44,068
Oh yeah, definitely.

324
00:17:44,068 --> 00:17:46,808
So cute!

325
00:17:47,888 --> 00:17:49,128
It's pretty exciting.

326
00:17:49,728 --> 00:17:51,668
Everyone we know probably knows about it.

327
00:17:51,668 --> 00:17:53,548
This is fun!

328
00:17:53,548 --> 00:17:54,248
I am.

329
00:17:54,248 --> 00:17:54,408
Wow.

330
00:17:55,368 --> 00:17:56,848
That much?

331
00:17:56,988 --> 00:17:58,268
I want to play a grown-up game!

332
00:17:58,828 --> 00:18:00,248
I'd love to try.

333
00:18:01,748 --> 00:18:03,528
Everyone, has Little Island done it too?

334
00:18:05,988 --> 00:18:06,848
Right now!?

335
00:18:07,928 --> 00:18:08,968
You don't seem to be enjoying yourself.

336
00:18:08,968 --> 00:18:09,488
Here?

337
00:18:09,488 --> 00:18:11,308
It's fun even with just us girls.

338
00:18:11,308 --> 00:18:13,888
I wonder what will happen?

339
00:18:13,888 --> 00:18:14,748
Right?

340
00:18:14,748 --> 00:18:17,268
Let's try this!

341
00:18:17,268 --> 00:18:18,928
Let's see if we like it.

342
00:18:19,988 --> 00:18:21,148
It just happened to be...

343
00:18:21,148 --> 00:18:21,748
What about you?

344
00:18:22,088 --> 00:18:22,468
Little Island.

345
00:18:22,848 --> 00:18:25,208
Little Island?

346
00:18:25,208 --> 00:18:26,148
I'm kinda drunk though...

347
00:18:27,388 --> 00:18:28,708
I'm gonna go in.

348
00:18:28,708 --> 00:18:29,888
Let's call Kojima.

349
00:18:30,488 --> 00:18:32,368
Maybe we don't need to be so subtle?

350
00:18:32,368 --> 00:18:33,148
This is intense!

351
00:18:34,108 --> 00:18:35,288
You're driving me wild.

352
00:18:35,288 --> 00:18:37,888
So naughty.

353
00:18:38,808 --> 00:18:39,548
Kojima...

354
00:18:40,608 --> 00:18:41,048
Hey,

355
00:18:42,288 --> 00:18:44,288
I want to play the King's Game.

356
00:18:44,288 --> 00:18:46,388
I really want to try the
Bridge of Broken Hearts game.

357
00:18:46,388 --> 00:18:47,908
I get it.

358
00:18:47,908 --> 00:18:51,128
Do you understand?

359
00:18:51,128 --> 00:18:53,988
I heard about it. I know what to do.

360
00:18:54,588 --> 00:19:02,808
Is it okay if we end here? Just the bar,
you and me, maybe a little...  *giggles*

361
00:19:04,148 --> 00:19:05,168
Yeah, sure. Right now?

362
00:19:12,528 --> 00:19:16,548
You're quick to get going, aren't you?

363
00:19:16,548 --> 00:19:18,008
Is this okay for you?

364
00:19:18,028 --> 00:19:18,648
You seem experienced.

365
00:19:30,088 --> 00:19:31,908
These and chopsticks would be pretty good,
wouldn't they?

366
00:19:33,368 --> 00:19:34,628
King-size design

367
00:19:36,028 --> 00:19:36,388
Wow!

368
00:19:36,868 --> 00:19:38,048
Can't you see it?

369
00:19:38,808 --> 00:19:39,528
I'll hide it later.

370
00:19:44,168 --> 00:19:45,508
Light the fire.

371
00:19:48,562 --> 00:19:51,642
And this will make it feel just like home...

372
00:19:53,882 --> 00:19:55,202
I'm getting so excited.

373
00:19:56,782 --> 00:19:57,822
What do you think?

374
00:19:58,922 --> 00:20:00,082
I couldn't handle it.

375
00:20:00,122 --> 00:20:01,322
It's good, right?!

376
00:20:04,702 --> 00:20:12,602
Let's shout together!

377
00:20:12,602 --> 00:20:14,182
Everyone, even adults...

378
00:20:15,362 --> 00:20:16,602
On the count of three...

379
00:20:17,022 --> 00:20:19,082
That's good!

380
00:20:20,382 --> 00:20:24,222
I think there are about two left.

381
00:20:24,522 --> 00:20:28,321
What should we do?
But first, it has to be...

382
00:20:28,371 --> 00:20:30,862
...something in the corners, right?

383
00:20:32,142 --> 00:20:35,142
I want to aim for the left side.

384
00:20:35,142 --> 00:20:36,742
What kind of people are there?

385
00:20:37,702 --> 00:20:41,642
The fourth one, let's go for it!
We just chugged a whole shot earlier...

386
00:20:42,522 --> 00:20:43,842
Okay, number four.

387
00:20:48,022 --> 00:20:49,502
You okay? Not drunk yet?

388
00:20:49,942 --> 00:20:52,142
I'm fine, totally fine.

389
00:20:52,522 --> 00:20:53,922
Let's go then!

390
00:20:56,962 --> 00:20:57,922
So fast!

391
00:21:05,002 --> 00:21:05,962
Fun!

392
00:21:21,432 --> 00:21:22,924
Yeah,

393
00:21:22,974 --> 00:21:26,572
What should we do?

394
00:21:40,917 --> 00:21:42,202
Oh man!

395
00:21:45,862 --> 00:21:46,902
Like me.

396
00:21:48,082 --> 00:21:49,182
What should I do?

397
00:21:53,162 --> 00:21:55,302
Since we're drinking...

398
00:21:57,242 --> 00:22:01,202
The second person to the fourth...

399
00:22:01,942 --> 00:22:03,562
drinks...

400
00:22:03,562 --> 00:22:03,882
Like...

401
00:22:06,162 --> 00:22:07,582
...it looks like they're
getting pretty mouthy.

